# Files the spelling gate does not check.
#
# **Prefer a per-line `spelling-ok` marker.** A line marker says which line and
# why. A file listed here is exempt whole — including whatever the file grows
# later — so it needs a reason that will still be true then.
#
# Format: one path per line, relative to the repo root. A line ending in `/`
# exempts everything under that directory. Blank lines and lines starting with
# `#` are ignored, so the reason for an entry lives right above it.
#
# Two reasons a file belongs here:
#
#   * It quotes outside material heavily enough that marking each line would
#     bury the prose — a standard's title, a benchmark's metric names.
#   * It is not ours to spell.
#
# Upstream skills are not ours to spell, including files a future update adds.
vendor/
